# The temple in the trolls' land at midnight, 48 wall torches whose only light is a static lamp of 700-900 cm: what
# the torch's own model and fire cost where the torches are many (reports/content/remaster/wall-torch-model). Four
# held views: a hall across 13 m, a torch at 3 m, a wall torch with two more through a doorway, a torch on a carved
# frieze. Compare sets with scripts/perf-content.sh A B temple. Animated draws are hidden on both sides.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 0 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
view hide animated morph
cam lift off
goto pos 83000 3660 24616
cam at 83000 3830 24616 81715 3770 24616
# Ten real seconds after the first teleport for loading and native simulation, five after the next ones.
wait 10000
set time 0 0
perf sample perf-temple/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
goto pos 82026 3613 24235
cam at 82026 3783 24235 81732 3773 24335
wait 5000
perf sample perf-temple/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
goto pos 79153 4045 20341
cam at 79153 4215 20341 79482 4205 20442
wait 5000
perf sample perf-temple/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
goto pos 83806 3757 28731
cam at 83806 3927 28731 84049 3917 28546
wait 5000
perf sample perf-temple/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
